The copy is already the minimal deep copy, so I kept the direct member-initializer form (no default-construct-then-assign) and matched the member declaration order so the compiler emits the tightest code and inlines the standard vector copy constructors.

```cpp
FieldBase::FieldBase(const FieldBase &field)
    : values(field.values), stringIndexes(field.stringIndexes)
{
}
```